    {
      "text": "God will turn thy captivity, Deut. 30:3. those carried he into captivity from Jerusalem, 2 Kgs. 24:15. the children of the province that went up out of the captivity, Ezra 2:1 (Neh. 7:6). when the Lord bringeth back the captivity of his people, Ps. 14:7 (53:6). thou hast led captivity captive, Ps. 68:18 (Eph. 4:8). When the Lord turned again the captivity of Zion, Ps. 126:1. pastors, and thy lovers shall go into captivity, Jer. 22:22. I will bring again the captivity of my people, Jer. 30:3 (Amos 9:14). I will cause their captivity to return, Jer. 32:44 (33:26). I will cause the captivity of Judah and the captivity of Israel, Jer. 33:7. their king shall go into captivity, Jer. 49:3. house of Israel went into captivity, Ezek. 39:23. I cause you to go into captivity beyond Damascus, Amos 5:27. when I turn back your captivity before your eyes, Zeph. 3:20.",
